@startuml kairos-app-settings-user-role-assignment-sequence
title Update App Settings and Assign User Roles

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open App Settings
WebAdmin -> API: GET /settings/app
API -> DB: SELECT app_settings
DB --> API: settings
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

Admin -> WebAdmin: Change theme/notification defaults\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: PUT /settings/app {changes}
API -> DB: UPDATE app_settings
DB --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

' User role assignment
Admin -> WebAdmin: Open User Role Assignment
WebAdmin -> API: GET /users?withRoles=true
API -> DB: SELECT users + roles
DB --> API: list
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

Admin -> WebAdmin: Change a user's role\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /security/user-roles {userId, roles}
API -> DB: INSERT/DELETE UserRole rows
DB --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

@enduml
